<title>FINLAND: Amer shareholders reject share conversion.</title>
<headline>Amer shareholders reject share conversion.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders in Finnish sporting goods group Amer-yhtyma Oy on Monday rejected a proposal by the board to convert vote-heavy unlisted K-shares into A-shares, the chairman of an extraordinary shareholders' meeting said.</p>
<p>The proposal was defeated by 20.4 million votes to 55,608, he said.</p>
</text>
